{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/20261havNsD8Sb1795341620.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>美職季後賽，國際邁阿密十六強首回合，主場0-3不敵哥倫布機員。</p><p></p><p>粉紅衫的邁阿密，9分鐘就輸十二碼，泰比亞射入，為哥倫布機員領先。邁阿密的美斯，之後有次近射被撲出，蘇亞雷斯亦有黃金機會，不過射斜，邁阿密全場8射4中，美斯射罰球，又被門將飛身拍出。</p><p></p><p>到36分鐘，盧贊飛剷犯規，收第二面黃牌離場，邁阿密十人應戰。哥倫布機員換邊後拉開，哈博尼52分鐘射入，加上6分鐘後，泰比亞攻入個人第二球，哥倫布機員贏3-0，下場返主場鬥回合。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-22T11:24:01.497581+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":211,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-22T09:48:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-23T00:17:35.951465+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-22T11:17:14.975484+00:00","content_hash":"0ee70b3efec1d0e56b20081ccb9c05e9d64952915afe5bd2c9b7f3b4d438ed0a","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-22T11:24:01.497581+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}